                (partialOp ? "Fast Partial Apply: no whole-human-figure pose snapshots/comparisons; item/material/link checks remain. Ordinary observation poll=8ms, quiet=80ms, minMatches=1; no structural no-op shortcut for partial property merges. Rollback and material rechecks remain conservative. Pose preservation is NOT verified." :
